layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /special-interests/
title: Special Interests
summary: Cycle touring, eco travel, motorcycle journeys, mountain passes, festivals, photography and winter adventures.
seo:
  title: "Special Interest Tours in Pakistan | Karakoram Vision"
  description: >-
    Cycling, motorcycling, photography, festivals, winter travel and eco tourism in northern Pakistan - trips built around one interest. Ask for ideas.
